      <div class="mc-value" style="color:#22c55e;">46%</div>
      <div class="mc-label">Land area freed</div>
      <div class="mc-context">Malaria endemic zone shrunk by nearly half</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ROW: HISTORICAL PROGRESS + DEATH TRENDS -->
  <div class="two-col" style="flex:1; min-height:0;">

    <!-- Historical Progress -->
    <div class="section" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
      <div class="section-label">Historical Progress</div>
      <h2>From Half the World to a Quarter</h2>
      <p>Malaria was once endemic across roughly 50% of the world's land surface &mdash; including Europe, North America, and East Asia. Historical figures like Abraham Lincoln and Oliver Cromwell contracted the disease.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:12px;">By 2002, the area at risk shrank to ~27%. The disease was eliminated from Europe, East Asia, Australia, and large parts of the Americas.</p>

      <div class="map-comparison">
        <div class="map-box">
          <div class="map-visual" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(239,68,68,0.18), rgba(239,68,68,0.04));">
            <div>
              <div class="percentage" style="color: #ef4444;">~50%</div>
              <div class="pct-label" style="color: #fca5a5;">of land surface</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="era-label">circa 1900</div>
        </div>
        <div class="map-arrow">&#10140;</div>
        <div class="map-box">
          <div class="map-visual" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34,197,94,0.18), rgba(34,197,94,0.04));">
            <div>
              <div class="percentage" style="color: #22c55e;">~27%</div>
              <div class="pct-label" style="color: #86efac;">of land surface</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="era-label">by 2002</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="drivers-row">
        <div class="driver-pill">
          <div class="dp-icon">&#128737;</div>
          <div class="dp-label">Public Health</div>
          <div class="dp-desc">Insecticides targeting mosquitoes</div>
        </div>
        <div class="driver-pill">
          <div class="dp-icon">&#127757;</div>
          <div class="dp-label">Land Use Change</div>
          <div class="dp-desc">Swamp drainage cut breeding</div>
        </div>
        <div class="driver-pill">
          <div class="dp-icon">&#127970;</div>
          <div class="dp-label">Development</div>
          <div class="dp-desc">Housing, nets, treatment access</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Death Trends Chart -->
    <div class="section" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
      <div class="section-label">Death Toll Trends</div>
      <h2>Malaria Deaths: 2000&ndash;2023</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:16px;">Deaths fell sharply from 2000 to 2015 before progress stalled. COVID-19 disruptions in 2020 pushed deaths back up. Both WHO and IHME agree: Africa accounts for the vast majority.</p>

