  <!-- ROW: BURDEN BARS -->
  <div class="section" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
    <div style="display:flex; gap:48px; align-items:center;">
      <div style="flex:1;">
        <div class="section-label">Regional Burden</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:32px;">Where Malaria Kills</h2>
      </div>
      <div style="flex:2;">
        <div class="burden-bars" style="margin:0;">
          <div class="burden-bar">
            <span class="bar-label">Sub-Saharan Africa</span>
            <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:93%; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ef4444,#f59e0b);"></div></div>
            <span class="bar-value" style="color:#ef4444;">~93%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="burden-bar">
            <span class="bar-label">Southeast Asia</span>
            <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:4%; background:#3b82f6; min-width:12px;"></div></div>
            <span class="bar-value" style="color:#3b82f6;">~4%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="burden-bar">
            <span class="bar-label">Other regions</span>
            <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:3%; background:#64748b; min-width:10px;"></div></div>
            <span class="bar-value" style="color:#64748b;">~3%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ROW: INTERVENTIONS -->
  <div class="section" style="margin-bottom:0;">
    <div class="section-label">Interventions</div>
    <h2 style="font-size:32px;">What Works: Tools to Beat Malaria</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">The same strategies that eliminated malaria from wealthy nations can be scaled in endemic regions today.</p>

    <div class="intervention-grid">
      <div class="intervention-card">
        <div class="ic-icon" style="background:rgba(59,130,246,0.15); color:#3b82f6;">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3v18"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Insecticide-Treated Bednets</h3>
        <p>One of the most cost-effective tools in global health. Prevents mosquito bites during sleep when transmission peaks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="intervention-card">
        <div class="ic-icon" style="background:rgba(34,197,94,0.15); color:#22c55e;">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Vaccines</h3>
        <p>New malaria vaccines offer a promising additional layer of protection, especially for young children in endemic regions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="intervention-card">
        <div class="ic-icon" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.15); color:#f59e0b;">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14"/><path d="M9 21v-4h6v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Economic Development</h3>
        <p>Better housing, healthcare access, and infrastructure reduce transmission and dramatically improve treatment outcomes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

