ers of elimination</div>", "+        <div class="driver-pill">", "+          <div class="dp-icon">&#127757;</div>", "+          <div class="dp-label">Land Use Change</div>", "+          <div class="dp-desc">Swamp drainage cut breeding</div>", "         </div>", "+        <div class="driver-pill">", "+          <div class="dp-icon">&#127970;</div>", "+          <div class="dp-label">Development</div>", "+          <div class="dp-desc">Housing, nets, treatment access</div>", "+        </div>", "       </div>", "     </div>", " ", "-    <!-- SECTION 2: Death Trends Chart (tall, spans 2 rows) -->", "-    <div class="section trends-section">", "+    <!-- Death Trends Chart -->", "+    <div class="section" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column;">", "       <div class="section-label">Death Toll Trends</div>", "       <h2>Malaria Deaths: 2000&ndash;2023</h2>", "-      <p style="margin-bottom:8px;">Global deaths fell sharply from 2000 to 2015, then progress stalled. COVID-19 disruptions in 2020 pushed deaths back up.</p>", "+      <p style="margin-bottom:16px;">Deaths fell sharply from 2000 to 2015 before progress stalled. COVID-19 disruptions in 2020 pushed deaths back up. Both WHO and IHME agree: Africa accounts for the vast majority.</p>", " ", "-      <div class="chart-container">", "-        <div class="chart-area">", "-          <svg class="chart-svg" viewBox="0 0 460 340" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">", "-            <!-- Grid lines -->", "-            <line x1="50" y1="20" x2="50" y2="290" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="1"/>", "-            <line x1="50" y1="290" x2="445" y2="290" stroke="#334155" stroke-width="1"/>", "-            <line x1="50" y1="236" x2="445" y2="236" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="4"/>", "-            <line x1="50" y1="182" x2="445" y2="182" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="4"/>", "-            <line x1="50" y1="128" x2="445" y2="128" stroke="#1e293b" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-dasharray="4"